{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 ZP Voice-Music Probe\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Sonda telemetrica passiva per canali, bus voce e musica/FX su memoria condivisa gmem (ZP Shared Bus v3): misura RMS, picco, crest factor, densita', brillantezza, speech activity e bilanciamento 4 zone Brown (-4,5 dB/oct) con profili distinti VOICE (range espressivo 85-14k Hz + controllo rumble <80 Hz) e FULL/MUS+FX (banda intera 40-14k Hz).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Passive telemetry probe for channels, voice and music/SFX buses using gmem shared memory (ZP Shared Bus v3): tracks RMS, peak, crest factor, density, brightness, speech activity and 4-zone Brown (-4.5 dB/oct) balance with distinct VOICE (expressive 85-14k Hz + sub <80 Hz rumble check) and FULL/MUS+FX (full 40-14k Hz) profiles.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Sviluppata su un'idea di Paolo Balestri \u183 ? Lato Cardioide (latocardioide.it) Guida completa: ZP Studio Suite/help/index.html#plugin-probe\par}
}

