LICENSE-LGPL-2.1.txt
}}}
 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "NOTICE.md"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
NOTICE.md
}}}
.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b No Warranty ("AS IS"):} ZP Suite is free, open-source software provided {\b "as is" without warranty of any kind}, either expressed or implied, including implied warranties of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose (pursuant to Sections 15\u8211-16 of the GNU GPLv3). You assume all risk regarding quality, performance, and suitability in production: always keep backups of important sessions and verify rendered deliverables. In no event shall the author be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages, downtime, or data loss arising from the use or inability to use this software.\par}
}
